msgid ""
"Accommodation is another area where you can cut costs while gaining a more "
"authentic experience. Guesthouses, hostels, and home rentals often provide a "
"closer connection to local life, and cost far less than traditional hotels. "
"Some travelers even arrange house-sitting or volunteer stays, exchanging "
"help for free lodging and meals."
msgstr ""
"住宿是另一个既能省钱又能获得更真实体验的方面。客栈、青年旅舍和民宿往往能让你"
"更贴近当地生活，而且比传统酒店便宜得多。有些旅行者甚至会安排看房换宿或义工住"
"宿，用帮忙换取免费食宿。"

