#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
msgid ""
"Constraints often spark innovation. When you lack funds, you're forced to "
"think outside the box, using free online platforms for marketing, bartering "
"skills for services, and building partnerships to reduce costs. Social "
"media, blogs, and community groups provide inexpensive ways to promote your "
"business and connect with potential clients."
msgstr ""
"限制往往能激发创新。资金不足时，你被迫跳出固有思维，利用免费的线上平台做推"
"广、以技能换取服务、建立合作关系来降低成本。社交媒体、博客和社区群组提供了低"
"成本的方式来推广业务并接触潜在客户。"

