msgstr "从在手机上轻点一下控制灯光，到自动煮好早晨的咖啡，智能家居技术已成为……"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"From remote mountains to coastal hideaways, Asia is full of destinations "
"that go unnoticed by the average tourist. These lesser-known spots offer the "
"same sense of wonder and discovery, often with more warmth, authenticity, "
"and room to breathe."
msgstr ""
"从偏远山区到海滨秘境，亚洲遍布着普通游客未曾留意的目的地。这些鲜为人知的地方"
"同样带来惊叹与发现的感受，而且往往更温暖、更真实，也更让人有喘息的空间。"

