"However, with these exciting developments come important questions about "
"privacy, ethics, and the impact on employment. As AI systems become more "
"autonomous, it is crucial to ensure they are designed and used responsibly, "
"keeping human values at the forefront. Addressing these challenges will "
"determine how beneficial AI ultimately is in everyday life."
msgstr ""
"然而，伴随这些令人兴奋的发展，也出现了关于隐私、伦理和对就业影响的重要问题。"
"随着人工智能系统变得更加自主，确保它们被负责任地设计和使用、把人类价值观放在"
"首位至关重要。能否解决这些挑战，将决定人工智能最终在日常生活中带来多大的益"
"处。"

