#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"Many travelers discover that being flexible with their plans can lead to big "
"savings. Choosing to travel off-season, flying mid-week, or visiting lesser-"
"known destinations can all make a big difference in price. Countries in "
"Southeast Asia, Eastern Europe, and Central America, for example, offer rich "
"experiences for just a fraction of the cost you'd expect in more touristy "
"regions."
msgstr ""
"许多旅行者发现，行程安排灵活能省下不少钱。选择淡季出行、周中乘机，或前往鲜为"
"人知的目的地，都能显著影响价格。例如，东南亚、东欧和中美洲的国家能以远低于热"
"门旅游地区的花费，带来丰富的体验。"

