msgid "Minimalism"
msgstr "极简主义"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
msgid ""
"Minimalism also helps break the cycle of consumerism. When you stop chasing "
"the next purchase or upgrade, you begin to appreciate what you already have. "
"This shift often leads to smarter spending, less waste, and a stronger sense "
"of gratitude."
msgstr ""
"极简主义也有助于打破消费主义的循环。当你不再追逐下一件购买或升级，你便开始珍"
"惜已经拥有的东西。这种转变往往会带来更明智的消费、更少的浪费和更强的感恩之"
"心。"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
msgid ""
"Minimalism isn't a trend or a strict set of rules. It's a mindset that helps "
"you focus on what counts and let go of what doesn't. Whether you're just "
"starting to declutter or already living with less, the benefits go far "
"beyond a clean space."
msgstr ""
"极简主义不是一种潮流，也不是一套严格的规则。它是一种心态，帮你专注于重要的"
"事，放下不重要的事。无论你刚刚开始整理，还是已经过着少物的生活，它的益处都远"
"不止一个整洁的空间。"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"Moreover, AI's influence extends beyond convenience to fostering deeper "
"human connections. Virtual companions and language translation tools break "
"down communication barriers, enabling people from diverse backgrounds to "
"connect more easily. This growing accessibility highlights AI's potential to "
"create a more inclusive and connected world."
msgstr ""
"此外，人工智能的影响已超越便利本身，延伸到促进更深层的人际联结。虚拟伴侣和语"
"言翻译工具打破了沟通障碍，让不同背景的人更容易相互连接。这种日益增强的可及性"
"凸显了人工智能构建更包容、更互联世界的潜力。"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
msgid ""
"Moreover, tapping into your existing skills and networks can be a game "
"changer. Offering consulting, tutoring, or digital services requires little "
"overhead and can generate revenue quickly. By focusing on what you already "
"know and who you know, you maximize your chances of early success."
msgstr ""
"此外，善用你已有的技能和人脉也能带来转机。提供咨询、辅导或数字服务几乎不需要"
"什么固定成本，却能快速产生收入。专注于你已掌握的知识和你认识的人，你就能最大"
"程度地提高早期成功的机会。"

