#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_2
msgid ""
"Smart homes are growing up. What began with simple voice assistants and "
"connected light bulbs has matured into fully integrated systems that manage "
"everything from energy use to home security. Artificial intelligence is at "
"the heart of this evolution, enabling homes to learn from behavior patterns "
"and anticipate needs in real time."
msgstr ""
"智能家居正在成长。从简单的语音助手和联网灯泡起步，如今已发展为完全集成的系"
"统，可管理从能源使用到家庭安全的一切。人工智能处于这场演进的核心，让住宅能够"
"从行为模式中学习并实时预判需求。"

#. module: website_blog
#: model:blog.post,subtitle:website_blog.blog_post_2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.s_dynamic_snippet_blog_posts_horizontal_preview_data
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.s_dynamic_snippet_blog_posts_single_circle_preview_data
