"revolution."
msgstr "智能家居不再是奢侈品。了解互联家居革命接下来会带来什么。"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"So if you're planning your next trip, consider stepping off the beaten path. "
"You might just find your new favorite place."
msgstr ""
